  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(12 fotos) El Ayuntamiento de Onda, a instancias de la Federaci&oacute;n Valenciana de Municipios y Provincial (FVMP), ha convocado a mediod&iacute;a de este lunes 1 minuto de silencio en repulsa por la violencia terrorista desatada en Par&iacute;s.&nbsp;</span></span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/11/P1220185.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Se ha sumado a la concentraci&oacute;n buena parte de la Coproraci&oacute;n Municipal, personal del Ayuntamiento, y vecinos y vecinas.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220180.jpg\" alt=\"p1220180\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220181.jpg\" alt=\"p1220181\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220182.jpg\" alt=\"p1220182\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220183.jpg\" alt=\"p1220183\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220185.jpg\" alt=\"p1220185\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220186.jpg\" alt=\"p1220186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220187.jpg\" alt=\"p1220187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220188.jpg\" alt=\"p1220188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220189.jpg\" alt=\"p1220189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220190.jpg\" alt=\"p1220190\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220191.jpg\" alt=\"p1220191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nouminutsilenciviolenciaterroristaparis161115/p1220192.jpg\" alt=\"p1220192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
